    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grafika66 \u2013 The Galleries</i></strong> is an interactive <strong>virtual art gallery</strong> built in Unreal Engine, designed to present a curated selection of digital art from the catalogue that acts as a complement to the <strong>Grafika66</strong> website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gallery offers 11 freely explorable spaces in 1st person, allowing visitors to navigate through a collection of digital paintings, limited-edition skate deck designs, and a small number of 3D sculptures. Each piece is carefully selected to reflect a blend of traditional and contemporary influences, offering a unique take on various forms and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Freely Explorable Gallery Spaces</strong> \u2013 Navigate through a series of exhibition rooms, each showcasing a mix of art in a minimalist, immersive setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Paintings &amp; 3D Sculptures</strong> \u2013 A focused selection of artwork, including fine art canvases, digital display panels, 3D sculptures, and skate deck designs displayed throughout the space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Navigation</strong> - Use the map to teleport to one of the 11 galleries, or simply take a casual browse through the first-person navigation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grafika66 \u2013 The Galleries</i></strong> is more than just a virtual art space\u2014it's an evolving exploration of digital and traditional artistry. Whether you\u2019re an art enthusiast or someone looking to engage with creativity in an interactive environment, this gallery offers a fresh way to experience modern art.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grafika66 \u2013 The Galleries</i></strong> is an interactive <strong>virtual art gallery</strong> built in Unreal Engine, designed to present a curated selection of digital art from the catalogue that acts as a complement to the <strong>Grafika66</strong> website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gallery offers 11 freely explorable spaces in 1st person, allowing visitors to navigate through a collection of digital paintings, limited-edition skate deck designs, and a small number of 3D sculptures. Each piece is carefully selected to reflect a blend of traditional and contemporary influences, offering a unique take on various forms and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Freely Explorable Gallery Spaces</strong> \u2013 Navigate through a series of exhibition rooms, each showcasing a mix of art in a minimalist, immersive setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Paintings &amp; 3D Sculptures</strong> \u2013 A focused selection of artwork, including fine art canvases, digital display panels, 3D sculptures, and skate deck designs displayed throughout the space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Navigation</strong> - Use the map to teleport to one of the 11 galleries, or simply take a casual browse through the first-person navigation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grafika66 \u2013 The Galleries</i></strong> is more than just a virtual art space\u2014it's an evolving exploration of digital and traditional artistry. Whether you\u2019re an art enthusiast or someone looking to engage with creativity in an interactive environment, this gallery offers a fresh way to experience modern art.</p>",
